/// \class ProductionUpdateModuleData
/// \ingroup grp_w1023_update_module_factories_c
/// \brief Module data for "ProductionUpdate": queue size, door animation
///        times and settings that Zero Hour's table does not have.
///
/// Built once per module line by
/// ProductionUpdateModuleData::friend_newModuleData and shared by every
/// object of the template. Its \c buildFieldParse registers the class's one
/// table and no base table. Zero Hour: ProductionUpdate queues and builds
/// a building's units and upgrades and drives its door animations.
///
/// \par Modding
/// INI fields, read from the retail table:
/// - shared with Zero Hour's table: \c MaxQueueEntries (an unsigned whole
///   number; Zero Hour reads it as a signed one), \c NumDoorAnimations (a
///   whole number), \c DoorOpeningTime, \c DoorWaitOpenTime,
///   \c DoorCloseTime and \c ConstructionCompleteDuration (durations),
///   \c QuantityModifier and \c DisabledTypesToProcess;
/// - not in Zero Hour's table: \c UnitInvulnerableTime and
///   \c SpecialPrepModelconditionTime (durations); \c GiveNoXP,
///   \c VeteranUnitsFromVeteranFactory,
///   \c SetBonusModelConditionOnSpeedBonus and \c SecondaryQueue
///   (booleans); \c BonusForType (a name, stored as text);
///   \c ProductionModifier and \c SpeedBonusAudioLoop.
///
/// \c QuantityModifier, \c DisabledTypesToProcess, \c ProductionModifier
/// and \c SpeedBonusAudioLoop are read by parsers this page does not
/// describe.
///
/// The instance factory registered for "ProductionUpdate" is not
/// documented in this group.
///
/// \see ProductionUpdateModuleData::friend_newModuleData

